  "description": "With only one semester left until graduation, my advisor—who holds my academic future in his hands—is my ex-boyfriend?!\n\n'Ye Ji-hye,' a long-overdue senior in the Department of Ceramics, has finally returned to school after being falsely accused of plagiarism. Standing right before her is the worst new professor, 'Do Hyun-woo,' tangling her up once again in lingering regrets and misunderstandings. Can Ji-hye successfully uncover the past conspiracy and finally hold her diploma?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/1642010356)",
